: TYPES:

: B :CHAR:GB: BOOLEAN
: S :CHAR:GB: DCMSTR :CHAR:EA:DEFAULT/RECOMMENDED STRING TYPE:CHAR:EB:
: DCS :CHAR:GB: DCSTR
: LETTERS :CHAR:GB: STRING IN STAGEL CHARACTER SET :CHAR:EA:CAPITAL A:CHAR:EF:Z:CHAR:EE: SLASH:CHAR:EE: COLON:CHAR:EE: SPACE:CHAR:EE: NEWLINE:CHAR:EE: BRACE:CHAR:EE: DOT:CHAR:EB:
: V/ :CHAR:GB: VERB :CHAR:EA:AN ADDITIONAL TYPE IS REQUIRED:CHAR:EB:
: L/ :CHAR:GB: LIST :CHAR:EA:A PRIMITIVE TYPE IS REQUIRED:CHAR:EB:
: VOID :CHAR:EA:DOES NOT HAVE A RETURN VALUE:CHAR:EB:
: NEVER :CHAR:EA:DOES NOT RETURN:CHAR:EB:
: VIEW: A STRUCT: :CHAR:EA:SOURCE:CHAR:JF:ID: UN:D:N:C::CHAR:EE: OFFSET: UN:G:N:E::CHAR:EE: LEN: UN:G:N:E::CHAR:EB:
: CURSOR: A MUTABLE READER POSITIONED AT POS: UN:G:N:E: WITHIN A VIEW :CHAR:EA:I GUESS THIS WOULD BE A :CHAR:EA:POS: UN:G:N:E::CHAR:EE: VIEW: VIEW:CHAR:EB::CHAR:EB:
: RESULT: ERR OR OK:CHAR:EA:TYPE:CHAR:EB:
: OPTION: NONE OR SOME:CHAR:EA:TYPE:CHAR:EB:
: PRIMITIVE TYPES:
: UN:I:
: IN:D:N:C:
: UN:D:N:C:
: IN:G:N:E:
: UN:G:N:E:
: IN:B:N:C:N:I:
: UN:B:N:C:N:I:
: INT :CHAR:EA:ARBITRARY:CHAR:EF:PRECISION:CHAR:EB:
: RAT :CHAR:EA:ARBITRARY:CHAR:EF:PRECISION: STRUCT :CHAR:EA:NUM: INT:CHAR:EE: DEN: INT:CHAR:EB::CHAR:EB:
: DC :CHAR:EA:IN EFFECT A UN:B:N:C:N:I::CHAR:EE: BUT TYPED:CHAR:EB:

: TESTS SPECIFY INPUT VALUE AND EXPECTED RETURN VALUES

: IDENTIFIERS ARE NOT CASE:CHAR:EF:SENSITIVE.

: NEWLINE OR BRACE ENDS A PARAMETER LIST

: DOT :CHAR:EA:OR SEMICOLON:CHAR:EE: WHICH IS NORMALIZED TO DOT IN INTERMEDIATE:CHAR:EB: ENDS A STATEMENT

: CONDITIONALS USE: IF COND IFTRUE IFFALSE

: LOOPS USE: WHILE COND VERB

: LIST ITERATION CAN USE: FOREACH LIST VERB

: :CHAR:DE:THIS:CHAR:DE: IS A RESERVED IDENTIFIER FOR USE BY THE CURRENT ELEMENT IN FOREACH LOOPS

: TYPING IS STRICT AND THERE IS NO AUTOMATIC COERCION


: LEADING LET IS IMPLICIT AND CAN BE OMITTED
LET V/B/ZL S/IN
    TEST WORKS WITH ZERO LENGTH STRING
        IN S:
        OUT N:B:
    TEST WORKS WITH NONZERO LENGTH STRING
        IN S:A
        OUT N:A:
    EQ N:A: LEN S/IN

LET V/S/GETFORMATIMPORTSETTING S/A S/B
    S:UNIMPLEMENTED

V/S/DCGETMAPPINGTOFORMAT S/A S/B
    S:UNIMPLEMENTED

V/B/NNE N/A N/B
    : NUMBER NOT EQUAL TO :CHAR:EA:THIS IS A COMMENT. ANY BYTES ALLOWED UNTIL NL:CHAR:EB:
    FALSE

: BRACE ENDS A PARAMETER LIST
LET V/B/SNEONE S/A S/B } FALSE

: SEMICOLON DESUGARS TO A DOT
LET V/B/SNETWO S/A S/B } FALSE.
: DOES THE SAME THING
LET V/B/SNETHREE S/A S/B } FALSE.

: THIS RETURNS S/B IF S/A IS EMPTY:CHAR:EE: ELSE S/A
LET V/B/DEFAULT S/A S/B / IF ZL S/A / S/B S/A

: THIS RETURNS A VERB NAMED :CHAR:DE:DEFAULT:CHAR:DE:
LET V/V/B/DEFAULT S/A S/B / /DEFAULT S/A S/B / IF ZL S/A / S/B S/A

: WRITTEN MORE NICELY
V/V/B/DEFAULT S/A S/B
    /DEFAULT S/A S/B / IF ZL S/A / S/B S/A

V/L/UN:D:N:C:/APPENDUN:D:N:C: LUN:D:N:C:/A LUN:D:N:C:/B
    : APPEND ONE LIST TO ANOTHER
    : UNIMPLEMENTED
    TEST WORKS
        IN L:N:A: N:B: L:N:C: N:D:
        OUT L:N:A: N:B: N:C: N:D:
    L:N:A: N:D: N:C: N:B:

V/S/GETTARGETLANGUAGEFORDCTCODETOTEXT
    NEW S/TARGETLANGUAGE GETFORMATIMPORTSETTING S:CODETOTEXT S:LANGUAGE
    IF ZL S/TARGETLANGUAGE : GETENVCODELANGUAGE : S/TARGETLANGUAGE

V/L/DCAFROMELAD S/IN
    : UNIMPLEMENTED
    L:N:A: N:B: N:C: N:D:

V/L/PUSH L/IN N/TOPUSH
    : UNIMPLEMENTED

V/L/CONVERTELEMENTANDAPPEND N/E S/TARGETLANGUAGE L/CONVERTED
    NEW S/TEMP DCGETMAPPINGTOFORMAT N/E S/TARGETLANGUAGE
    IF NE N:A: LEN S/TEMP } LAPPEND L/RES DCAFROMELAD S/TEMP } PUSH L/RES N/CURRENTDC
    : ALTERNATIVELY:CHAR:EE: CAN INDENT ARGUMENTS FOR READABILITY :CHAR:EA:THIS IS STILL ONE LOGICAL LINE:CHAR:EB:. ONLY ONE LEVEL OF INDENTATION ALLOWED.
    IF
        NE N:A: LEN S/TEMP }
        LAPPEND L/RES DCAFROMELAD S/TEMP }
        PUSH L/RES N/CURRENTDC

E:L/DCTCODETOTEXT L/IN
    NEW L/RES
    NEW S/TARGETLANGUAGE GETTARGETLANGUAGEFORDCTCODETOTEXT
    EACH L/IN SET L/RES CONVERTELEMENTANDAPPEND /E S/TARGETLANGUAGE L/RES
    L/RES
